    stops={{"rare",219,0.5215,0.4231,"Zerillis","Zerillis","돌아다님","Wanders around",{}},{"boss",219,0.5429,0.2664,"순교자 데카","Theka the Martyr","","",{596}},{"boss",219,0.6445,0.2738,"안투술","Antu'sul","","",{595}},{"boss",219,0.4424,0.1757,"의술사 줌라","Witch Doctor Zum'rah","가까이 가면 적대적으로 변하고 무덤에서 좀비를 일으킵니다. 그의 수호물을 빨리 파괴하세요","Turns hostile when you come close and raises zombies from the graves. Destroy his ward quickly",{597}},{"boss",219,0.2969,0.1625,"네크룸 거트츄어","Nekrum Gutchewer","계단 이벤트의 마지막 공격 때 세즈지즈와 함께 옵니다. 피라미드 꼭대기의 우리에서 시작하세요","Comes with Sezz'ziz as the last wave of the stairs event. Start it at the cages on top of the pyramid",{598}},{"boss",219,0.315,0.178,"어둠의사제 세즈지즈","Shadowpriest Sezz'ziz","네크룸 거트츄어와 함께 싸우며 그를 치유합니다: 치유 주문을 차단하세요","Fights together with Nekrum and heals him: interrupt his heals",{599}},{"optional",219,0.2207,0.1596,"Sergeant Bly","Sergeant Bly","우리를 열면 계단 이벤트가 시작됩니다. 블라이는 자동 탐사막대에 대해 물어볼 때만 싸웁니다 (퀘스트)","Opening the cages starts the stairs event. Bly only fights if asked about the Divino-matic Rod (quest)",{}},{"boss",219,0.2949,0.3807,"유체술사 벨라타","Hydromancer Velratha","","",{593}},{"optional",219,0.3125,0.407,"가즈릴라","Gahz'rilla","징에서 줄파락의 나무망치로 소환","Summoned at the gong with the Mallet of Zul'Farrak",{594}},{"rare",219,0.2959,0.4304,"Dustwraith","Dustwraith","","",{}},{"rare",219,0.456,0.549,"Sandarr Dunereaver","Sandarr Dunereaver","","",{}},{"boss",219,0.4248,0.3338,"족장 우코르즈 샌드스칼프","Chief Ukorz Sandscalp","루즐루와 함께. 계단 이벤트 후 위글리가 폭파하는 문 뒤에 있습니다: 블라이보다 먼저 위글리에게 말을 거세요","With Ruuzlu. Behind the door Weegli blasts open after the stairs event: talk to Weegli before Bly",{600}}},
